Z||000009||Turbo88||12-12-2001||04:28 PM||||On my 88 Formula, I have to push and hold the trip meter reset button for a mile or so while driving and it will start to work just fine... That ticking is damn annoying!||||reg||1
Z||000010||Eriamjh||12-12-2001||09:00 PM||||Actually, doesn't it say either in the owners manual or the service manual not to puch the reset button while moving or you could damage the mechanism.<P>Mine ticks occasionally too.  Multiple resets does the trick.  I think the gears get hung up if not reset properly.||||reg||1
